        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2070_rival_10",
      "hash64": "8756C258BF45E7F1",
      "text": "派帕说“激斗校园大战”\\n这个名字好……[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2070_rival_11",
      "hash64": "8756C158BF45E63E",
      "text": "克拉韦尔校长也觉得那名字不错时，\\n还真是让我伤脑筋呢！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2070_rival_03",
      "hash64": "8753BF58BF43AD01",
      "text": "……[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n你做好心理准备了吗！？[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
